{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正享受与对方的亲近，暂时不想考虑以后；心里有喜欢，也想确认对方是否一样，却没能开口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静、亲近、自在；迟疑、克制\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间小字里的“重要的话还留在余味里”“水下暗流拖住”“声音绕远”“顺畅里有阻力”等，需要逐句读才能理解。右上角两条分类文字也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正在享受两个人的亲近，不想急着考虑以后；想表达喜欢、确认对方心意，但话到了嘴边又退了回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、沉静、亲密；短暂急切、犹豫、克制\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的“摇曳中忽然冒出几句短促急切的声音”“念头刚露头，很快又沉下去”有助于理解他的心理变化，但夹在多条小字中，第一眼不容易抓到。其他水波、暗流、倒影等意象也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他处在与对方亲近而舒服的相处中，心里有很多喜欢，却没想好怎么表达，也没有急着追问未来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"自在、安静、亲近、留恋；犹豫、克制、欲言又止\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间多条小字仍然需要逐句阅读，尤其是“短促急切的声音”“念头刚露头又沉下去”和“顺畅里有阻力”之间的关系，不容易仅凭扫读理清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"中间的小字区域把多个心理变化和画面意象横向并排，条数多、单条也不短，缺少明确的阅读优先级。上下两段大字其实能形成清楚的故事：享受亲近、心里喜欢、想说却没说；但中间这些内容一眼扫过时容易成为彼此分散的意象，需要读完后才能知道它们都在补充同一个人的迟疑和情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20bd0c5f-4f9d-459a-b2ee-cecda1b25e48", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T223951980931Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:41:17.490286+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "595312575a1411f08610259f32da77110f3d3949a7e456d5d59f044016eaf3b8", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T223951980931Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f579efda6427bf4a2f199cf85a480051926d602f78143da42085c5c5d91b07af"}}}
